# The QuackOS desktop session (docs/de-design.md, phase 1): labwc compositor + our own shell (PySide6/QML).
# Every name below was checked against the Debian 13 (trixie) Packages index on 2026-10-14.
labwc
# (Xwayland is already listed in another list: it runs the X11 apps of the suite)
swaybg
swayidle
swaylock
wlopm
mako-notifier
# notify-send (screenshots, the shell) and a Qt file manager that is not KDE (until Quack Files exists)
libnotify-bin
pcmanfm-qt
fuzzel
foot
grim
slurp
wl-clipboard
brightnessctl
# portals: screen sharing on wlroots, file dialogs from GTK
xdg-desktop-portal
xdg-desktop-portal-wlr
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
# the shell: Qt Quick over layer-shell; pywayland follows the open windows (wlr-foreign-toplevel-management)
python3-pywayland
# python3-pywayland imports _cffi_backend but does not depend on it (found in QEMU: 'No module named pywayland._ffi')
python3-cffi-backend
python3-pyside6.qtcore
python3-pyside6.qtgui
python3-pyside6.qtqml
python3-pyside6.qtquick
qt6-wayland
qt6-svg-plugins
qml6-module-org-kde-layershell
qml6-module-qtquick
qml6-module-qtquick-window
qml6-module-qtqml
qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript
qml6-module-qtquick-templates
qml6-module-qtquick-layouts
